@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

title SD-06 - Search and filter skills
actor "Student" as Student
boundary ":SkillController" as Controller
control ":ListingService" as Service
participant ":SkillListing\nRepository" as Listings

Student -> Controller: submit search text and category
Controller -> Service: search(query, categoryId)
Service -> Service: normalize and validate criteria

alt invalid search criteria
Service --> Controller: field errors; no search
Controller --> Student: search form with feedback
else valid search criteria
Service -> Listings: searchActive(normalizedQuery, categoryId)
Listings --> Service: matching listings / empty list
Service -> Service: prepare public listing summaries
Service --> Controller: listing summaries / empty list
Controller --> Student: results or no-results message
end

' Signed-in browsing only; blank text/category adds no corresponding restriction.
' Query: active=true AND (title OR description matches) AND optional category.
' Binding errors stop at the controller; persistence errors return retry feedback.
' No writes or booking locks. Results omit private data; SD-02 rechecks activity.
@enduml
